<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cerus Corp started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cerus Corp started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it initiated coverage of Cerus Corp as a strong buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-month price target of $20 a share.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Cerus launched its initial public offering on January 31. Morgan Stanley was the lead underwriter of the offering.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
